    "Design is guided by purpose—not simply appearance, but emotion and value.": "Ang disenyo ay ginagabayan ng layunin—hindi lamang sa itsura, kundi pati sa damdamin at halaga.",
    "Every project is a reminder that behind each photograph is a person, a moment, and a memory worth preserving.": "Bawat proyekto ay paalala na sa likod ng bawat larawan ay may tao, sandali, at alaalang nararapat panatilihin.",
